// test: run
// modes: interp native
// timeout: 60
// exit: 101
// stdout: start inner\n
// QA T413 round 1: SPEC-32 AXS-SYNC-021.1 -- with_mut on the same LocalKey while an outer `with`
// borrow is active on the same thread must panic (exit 101); the closure body never runs.

